# A replay script: what happened, instead of who was at the keyboard.
#
# `tick` lets the next timer come due — here, one step of the snake. `frame`
# draws. `seed` fixes the stream the food is placed from, so this file is the
# whole of the run: the same script gives the same picture every time, which is
# what makes a game testable.

seed 7
frame               # the opening board

tick                # four steps to the right
tick
tick
tick
frame

key up              # turn, and eat what is waiting at the top
tick
tick
frame

key left            # away again, growing tail and all
tick 450
frame

key up              # into the wall: a game over is a state, not an exit
tick 600
frame

key q               # and `q` is what leaves
